      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:3:4:84:24",
      "text": [
        " أَخْبَرَنِي أَبَانُ بْنُ تَغْلِبَ قَالَ قُلْتُ لِأَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) أَيَّةَ سَاعَةٍ كَانَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) يُوتِرُ فَقَالَ عَلَى مِثْلِ مَغِيبِ الشَّمْسِ إِلَى صَلَاةِ الْمَغْرِبِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Muhammad Bin Al-Husayn, from Ibn Abu Umeyr, from Ismail Bin Abu Sara who said, ",
          "‘Aban Bin Taghlub informed me saying, ‘I said to Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup>, ‘During which time did Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> pray <span class=\"iTxt\">Al-Witr </span>(Salāt)?’ So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Upon the like of the setting of the sun up to <span class=\"iTxt\">Al-Maghrib Salāt</span>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "24. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Al-Husayn ibn abu ‘Umayr from ’Isma‘il ibn abu Sarah from Aban ibn Taghlib who has said the following: “I once asked abu ’Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, ’What time did the Messenger of Allah perform al- Witr?’ He (the Imam) said, ’Within a time like from sunset to al-Maghrib Salah (prayer).’” "
        ]
      }
